      "writtenOn": "2023-12-21T09:11:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While storage migration has dryRunOnly (attempts already reach target attempts, but still do comparison),\nI tried to simplify the process by deleting dryRunOnly since we have A/B rollout.\nThus, I tried to use success + failure to replace attempts.\nWhile storage migration checks targetAttempts \u003e\u003d attempts,\nI check targetAttempts \u003e\u003d success + failure instead.\nThus, there is no attempts variable set after success or fail.\nWDYT?",
